OL,3,GNEWSAFormer first ministers
OL,4,A'disappointed' by PM's devolution calls
OL,5,Arejection
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo former Labour first ministers have
OL,8,Fexpressed their disappointment at the
OL,9,Fdecision by the prime minister not to
OL,10,Fdevolve further powers to the Senedd.
OL,12,FMark Drakeford and Carwyn Jones were
OL,13,Fresponding to the confirmation that
OL,14,Fcontrol over policing and criminal
OL,15,Fjustice, rail infrastructure and the
OL,16,Fcrown estate would be retained at
OL,17,FWestminster rather than passed on to
OL,18,FCardiff.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
