OL,3,GNEWSAFormer first ministers
OL,4,A'disappointed' by PM's devolution calls
OL,5,Arejection
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a letter to First Minister Rhun ap
OL,8,FIorwerth, Andy Burnham said he had not
OL,9,Fbeen persuaded by the case for further
OL,10,Fdevolution in those areas.
OL,12,FDrakeford told Politics Wales: "I am
OL,13,Fdisappointed by the letter. The prime
OL,14,Fminister talks a great deal about
OL,15,Fdevolution and he understands it very
OL,16,Fwell indeed in an English context.
